0..77 Comment "// The completion subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
78..149 Comment "// every source that reads them (`import \"./ring-base.gandr\";`): a mock"
150..228 Comment "// kernel\'s submission protocol after io_uring, whose manual states that there"
229..303 Comment "// is \"exactly one matching CQE for every SQE\" (io_uring(7)). A submission"
304..379 Comment "// queue entry is received and one completion queue entry is posted; on the"
380..457 Comment "// submitter\'s side, what remains after a submit is the pending completion it"
458..535 Comment "// must reap. The buffer a read fills is moved into its submission and handed"
536..614 Comment "// back with its completion, because the kernel owns it while the operation is"
615..663 Comment "// in flight (boats, _Notes on io-uring_, 2020)."
665..737 Comment "/// A ring: its entries sealed behind the interface, the protocol of one"
738..815 Comment "/// submission as the kernel serves it, the buffer and the pending completion"
816..888 Comment "/// on the submitter\'s side, the protocols that take a buffer, a pending"
889..966 Comment "/// completion or a target\'s pending completion over a session, and one entry"
967..984 Comment "/// of each kind."
